```{=html}
<div class="board-grid">
<% for (const item of items) { %>
  <div class="board-card">
    <img src="<%= templateParams.root %><%= item.photo %>" alt="<%= item.name %>">
    <span class="name"><%= item.name %></span>
    <span class="role"><%= templateParams.lang === 'en' ? item.role_en : item.role_sv %></span>
    <% if (item.affiliation) { %><span class="affil"><%= item.affiliation %></span><% } %>
  </div>
<% } %>
</div>
```
